NM1 → NM3; NM2 → NM3; NM1 and NM2 are independent and may run in either order.
NM3 → NM4 → close. NM4's first checkpoint (DC1) runs right after plan approval,
before NM2 and NM3 code, and needs only the approved plan. Nothing depends on provider review, downstream execution,
publication or certification.

| Artifact | Home |
